        "TileImage": "$($repository 80051c02-e026-40fe-970a-7b7aaa62302c).Image",
        "Description": "Two assassins, completely unaware of one anothers presence. Our previous intel on the Kashmirian remains the same, however, the second target got through our initial screening. While intensely committed to his persona as &quot;The Painter&quot; , Babu Raav has been revealed to be yet another assassin whose target is currently unknown, likely Rangan or his security chief. Regardless, it&apos;s time to take out the competition. Show them how a true world renowned professional handles a contract. Good luck, 47.",
